PTX CoWW+alias+fence.proxy.alias
"As CoWW+alias, with fence.proxy.alias between the stores: the fence orders operations on aliases (8.6), so the stores keep program order in coherence order and x == 1 at the end is forbidden."
{
x = 0;
y @ generic aliases x;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0     ;
 st.weak x, 1       ;
 fence.proxy.alias  ;
 st.weak y, 2       ;
exists
(x == 1)
